### ==========================================================
### USERS — perfil propio, timezone, cambio de password
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.user.id}}

### Get propio perfil (éxito) — incluye timezone, sin password
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update nombre (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tester Renamed" }

### Update timezone (éxito) — cambia el bucketing de stats/budgets
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timezone": "America/New_York" }

### Cambio de password (éxito) — revoca refresh tokens vivos
### Ojo: tras esto, vuelve a login con la nueva password.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewSecureP@ss123" }

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Otro usuario — Forbidden (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update — timezone inválida (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timezone": "Nope/Nope" }

### Update — body vacío (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Mass assignment — intentar setear tokenVersion (se ignora, no error)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "tokenVersion": 999 }

### GET /users (colección) — eliminado (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (soft) — deja el usuario archivado
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
